{"4576840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MayDay MayDie", "steam_appid": 4576840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust No One in the Sky!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a group of passengers, your only chance to survive is to work together while your plane’s engines fail one by one, cabin pressure drops, and critical systems collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there’s one problem… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your closest friend might actually be a hijackers trying to turn the plane into a fireball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔧 Cooperation &amp; Tasks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the plane, players must complete tasks that appear in different areas.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart complex systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up correct connections and configurations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep critical devices stable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right solutions through trial and error</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tasks require precision, others demand speed.<br>Some will punish you for mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly:<br><strong>You can’t do everything alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/221893eac6d6e4424cd26bb90e6c5916.poster.avif?t=1785768743\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/221893eac6d6e4424cd26bb90e6c5916.webm?t=1785768743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/221893eac6d6e4424cd26bb90e6c5916.mp4?t=1785768743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔪 Sabotage &amp; Betrayal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hijackers hiding among you; instead of attacking directly, they’re working from within.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disable critical systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delay task completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start onboard fires that damage the aircraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drain the plane’s fuel, bringing it closer to a crash</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And while doing all this…<br><strong>They act like they’re on your side.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/7d78822b5ebdf72ab189d473374ee000.poster.avif?t=1785768743\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/7d78822b5ebdf72ab189d473374ee000.webm?t=1785768743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/7d78822b5ebdf72ab189d473374ee000.mp4?t=1785768743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer experience for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time tasks and sabotage mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly increasing tension and chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization with different outfits and appearances</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust No One in the Sky!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a group of passengers, your only chance to survive is to work together while your plane’s engines fail one by one, cabin pressure drops, and critical systems collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there’s one problem… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your closest friend might actually be a hijackers trying to turn the plane into a fireball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔧 Cooperation &amp; Tasks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the plane, players must complete tasks that appear in different areas.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart complex systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up correct connections and configurations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep critical devices stable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right solutions through trial and error</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tasks require precision, others demand speed.<br>Some will punish you for mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly:<br><strong>You can’t do everything alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/221893eac6d6e4424cd26bb90e6c5916.poster.avif?t=1785768743\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/221893eac6d6e4424cd26bb90e6c5916.webm?t=1785768743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/221893eac6d6e4424cd26bb90e6c5916.mp4?t=1785768743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔪 Sabotage &amp; Betrayal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hijackers hiding among you; instead of attacking directly, they’re working from within.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disable critical systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delay task completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start onboard fires that damage the aircraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drain the plane’s fuel, bringing it closer to a crash</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And while doing all this…<br><strong>They act like they’re on your side.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/7d78822b5ebdf72ab189d473374ee000.poster.avif?t=1785768743\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/7d78822b5ebdf72ab189d473374ee000.webm?t=1785768743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576840/extras/7d78822b5ebdf72ab189d473374ee000.mp4?t=1785768743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer experience for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time tasks and sabotage mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly increasing tension and chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization with different outfits and appearances</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A first-person social deduction game on a luxury plane, featuring real-time action and betrayal for up to 8 players. Passengers rush to complete tasks and survive violent turbulence to land the airliner, while hidden Hijackers sabotage it to force a crash. No voting, just pure paranoia.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co